  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECW: Education al-an - Increased Access to Safe,  Protective and Inclusive Quality Education to   support well-being and learning outcomes.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This  program  aims  to enable conflict affected  girls  and  boys, including  adolescents to  have increased and continuous access to safe, protective, inclusive, and quality education to support their well-being and learning outcomes. The interventions are articulated around four outcomes addressing the most pressing education and protection needs of children and youth in Iraq, such as  deterioration  of  access,  equity, and  quality  of  education  as  described  in  the  ECW-MYRP theory of change.</narrative>
  </description>
